{"title":"Salsa Cycles Refreshes the Beargrease Fat Bike with Big Wheels & Modern Geometry","link":"https://bikerumor.com/salsa-cycles-refreshes-the-beargrease-fat-bike-with-big-wheels-modern-geometry/","date":1789646460000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-hero.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"670\" alt=\"(Photos / Salsa Cycles)\" /></p>\n<p>Along with new carbon rims, Minnesota’s Salsa Cycles has also announced a refresh to the Beargrease fat bike. The new version draws on the brand’s history with fat-tire designs going back to their first model, the Mukluk, all the way back in 2010. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Then, in 2014, the first Beargrease was introduced. Now, here we are with a new and improved Beargrease… let’s check it out.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike first pic\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-first-pic-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / Salsa Cycles)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This latest Beargrease is built around 27.5 x 4.5″ tires. Salsa says this balances traction and stability across a range of conditions, from winter ultramarathon racing to shralping groomed singletrack sessions.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike night solo\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-night-solo-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Beargrease is available with either a carbon fiber or 6061-T6 aluminum frame.  Each of these frame choices is paired with the new Bearpaw forks in either carbon or aluminum, depending on frame choice. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"997\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike carbon sram\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram-297x231.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram-120x93.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram-768x598.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-carbon-sram-1155x900.jpeg 1155w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike bone\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-bone-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>What About the Geo, Bro?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Salsa says the new Beargrease’s geometry has shifted closer to what you’d find on a modern trail bike. It features a steeper seat tube angle, slacker head tube angle, and longer chainstays. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike dos riding snow\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-dos-riding-snow-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In practical terms, this means your weight sits more centered over the bike, which helps with handling on slippery or low-traction surfaces while still keeping things manageable on tighter trails. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"1005\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large.jpeg\" alt=\"SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new Large\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large-297x233.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large-120x94.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large-768x603.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SAL_Geo_Mtn_Hardtail_VF_new-Large-1146x900.jpeg 1146w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><table><tbody><tr><th>Size</th><th>X-Small</th><th>Small</th><th>Medium</th><th>Large</th><th>X-Large</th></tr><tr><th>A. Effective Top Tube</th><td>560.0</td><td>582.0</td><td>605.0</td><td>629.0</td><td>654.0</td></tr><tr><th>B. Stand Over</th><td>682.0</td><td>710.0</td><td>741.0</td><td>775.0</td><td>805.0</td></tr><tr><th>C. Reach</th><td>425.0</td><td>445.0</td><td>465.0</td><td>485.0</td><td>505.0</td></tr><tr><th>D. Stack</th><td>583.0</td><td>592.0</td><td>605.0</td><td>624.0</td><td>646.0</td></tr><tr><th>E. Total Seat Tube Length</th><td>355.0</td><td>392.0</td><td>430.0</td><td>455.0</td><td>480.0</td></tr><tr><th>F. Headtube Length</th><td>95.0</td><td>105.0</td><td>120.0</td><td>140.0</td><td>165.0</td></tr><tr><th>G. Headtube Angle</th><td>65.6</td><td>65.6</td><td>65.6</td><td>65.6</td><td>65.6</td></tr><tr><th>H. Seat Tube Angle</th><td>77.0</td><td>77.0</td><td>77.0</td><td>77.0</td><td>77.0</td></tr><tr><th>I. BB Drop</th><td>69.0</td><td>69.0</td><td>69.0</td><td>69.0</td><td>69.0</td></tr><tr><th>J. BB Height</th><td>321.0</td><td>321.0</td><td>321.0</td><td>321.0</td><td>321.0</td></tr><tr><th>K. Chainstay Length</th><td>446.0</td><td>446.0</td><td>446.0</td><td>446.0</td><td>446.0</td></tr><tr><th>L. Fork Length Axle to Crown</th><td>485.0</td><td>485.0</td><td>485.0</td><td>485.0</td><td>485.0</td></tr><tr><th>M. Fork Offset</th><td>44.0</td><td>44.0</td><td>44.0</td><td>44.0</td><td>44.0</td></tr><tr><th>N. Wheelbase</th><td>1147.0</td><td>1171.0</td><td>1197.0</td><td>1226.0</td><td>1256.0</td></tr><tr><th>Crank Arm Length</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>Handlebar Width</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>Recommended Rider Height</th><td>147.0 – 160.0</td><td>157.0 – 170.0</td><td>168.0 – 180.0</td><td>178.0 – 191.0</td><td>188.0 – 201.0</td></tr><tr><th>Stem Length</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Inspiration From the Past</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>According to Salsa’s product team, this Beargrease refresh draws inspiration from two previous platforms. It pulls from both the exploration-focused Heyday and the race-oriented Beargrease. When combined, you get a bike that can handle a wider variety of riding styles. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"775\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike frameset\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset-297x180.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset-120x73.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-frameset-768x465.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"956\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike purple\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple-297x222.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple-120x90.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple-768x574.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-purple-1205x900.jpeg 1205w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Beargrease Retail &amp; Frame Details</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Beargrease C Frameset: $1.999<br />Beargrease C GX AXS: $5,999<br />Beargrease C Eagle 90: $4,299<br />Beargrease C Eagle 70: $3,299<br />Beargrease Eagle 70: $1,999<br />Beargrease C CUES 11: $2,320</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"971\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike aluminum\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum-297x225.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum-120x91.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum-768x583.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-aluminum-1186x900.jpeg 1186w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Frameset Details:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Frame weight: 5 lb. 9 oz. with axles, collar, headset, and uncut steerer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Frame: Beargrease Carbon</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Color: Twilight Purple</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fork: Bearpaw Carbon</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Headset: FSA NO.57E-T</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Front Axle: 15mm Thru x 150mm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rear Axle: 12mm Thru x 197mm</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows.jpeg\" alt=\"Salsa Cycles New Beargrease Fat Tire Bike snowy shadows\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Salsa-Cycles-New-Beargrease-Fat-Tire-Bike-snowy-shadows-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Beargrease is available now through Salsa Cycles. To check out the full build kit details, they can be found on the Salsa website; click the link below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.salsacycles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">SalsaCycles.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/salsa-cycles-refreshes-the-beargrease-fat-bike-with-big-wheels-modern-geometry/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"09b057529da5e0fc85cef3e25a602e3fd7761ccb942c4bd32dfa0ee5f464b93f","category":"Cycling"}